starts twitching,

00:03:00.813 --> 00:03:03.216 size:84% position:42%
you get to go, "Can you
hold her for a second?"

00:03:03.216 --> 00:03:04.117 line:92%
And there's someone to do that.

00:03:04.117 --> 00:03:06.619
And now you go,
"Can you hold her? Who's this?"

00:03:06.619 --> 00:03:07.387 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:03:07.387 --> 00:03:09.255 size:81% position:41%
-I'm like, "Number two
gets passed to you."

00:03:09.255 --> 00:03:10.723 align:start size:94% position:6%
And there's no break.
-Yeah.

00:03:10.723 --> 00:03:12.392 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I just FaceTimed
right before the show

00:03:12.392 --> 00:03:15.295 align:start size:94% position:6%
