just both kids and the dog.

00:03:15.295 --> 00:03:17.730 align:start size:94% position:6%
And she was laughing
like the Joker.

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:19.832 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Like, so, like, she was happy

00:03:19.832 --> 00:03:21.701 align:start size:94% position:6%
and smiling, but, like,
the way you do before you,

00:03:21.701 --> 00:03:24.304 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, poison a city's water.
-Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:03:24.304 --> 00:03:25.071 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:03:25.071 --> 00:03:27.540 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's called new parenthood.
-Yeah.

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:29.275 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's what I tapped into
in the movie.

00:03:29.275 --> 00:03:32.278 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You did! But you
really genuinely did

00:03:32.278 --> 00:03:33.913 align:start size:94% position:6%
tap into movie because --
I mean,

00:03:33.913 --> 00:03:36.382 align:start size:94% position:6%
obviously, you and Emily
play parents,

00:03:36.382 --> 00:03:37.584 line:92%
which you are in real life.

00:03:37.584 --> 00:03:40.019 align:start size:94% position:6%
The kids -- you cast
the most wonderful kids.

00:03:40.019 --> 00:03:40.820 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Unbelievable.
-Yeah.

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:42.622 size:81% position:41%
-I've always been told
don't work with kids.

00:03:42.622 --> 00:03:45.091
They never know their lines
and they have kid hours,

00:03:45.091 --> 00:03:48.261
which are shorter than yours.
And they're not professional.

00:03:48.261 --> 00:03:49.696 align:start size:94% position:6%
I had the exact opposite
experience.

00:03:49.696 --> 00:03:51.965 align:start size:94% position:6%
These kids are --
I probably slowed them down.

00:03:51.965 --> 00:03:53.266 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-They're the most professional

00:03:53.266 --> 00:03:55.034 align:start size:94% position:6%
