any lines?

00:03:56.769 --> 00:03:57.704 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No.
-You put them in a movie

00:03:57.704 --> 00:03:58.838 align:start size:94% position:6%
where they're not allowed
to talk.

00:03:58.838 --> 00:03:59.706 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I didn't. Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:03:59.706 --> 00:04:01.307 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like,
"Oh, you think you're good?

00:04:01.307 --> 00:04:03.042 line:92%
