00:04:03.042 --> 00:04:04.110 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:04.844 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Deal with that, kid!

00:04:04.844 --> 00:04:07.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, you did deal with it.
Oh, wow! You did very well."

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:09.182 line:92%
