00:04:15.388 --> 00:04:17.190 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Oh, these are the ones."
-Oh, instantaneously.

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:19.859 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, so, Noah Jupe,
who plays my son in the movie,

00:04:19.859 --> 00:04:21.828 align:start size:94% position:6%
is unbelievable.
He was in "The Night Manager",

00:04:21.828 --> 00:04:23.730 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he had just worked with
George Clooney.

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:26.332 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so I e-mailed George --
[Chuckles]

00:04:26.332 --> 00:04:27.433 size:78% position:39% line:92%
