00:04:27.433 --> 00:04:28.134 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:28.134 --> 00:04:29.202 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Hey, George."
And then he was like,

00:04:29.202 --> 00:04:31.571 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Don't ever write here again."
I was like, "Oh, wow!"

00:04:31.571 --> 00:04:32.105 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:32.105 --> 00:04:34.440 align:start size:94% position:6%
No, and he just said
he was the best child actor

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:35.942 align:start size:94% position:6%
