I've worked with them all."

00:04:39.112 --> 00:04:40.046 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, that's --
-Literally.

00:04:40.046 --> 00:04:42.482
-Yeah.
-And then the other unbelievable

00:04:42.482 --> 00:04:46.552 align:start size:94% position:6%
