that she's not from here,

00:04:56.396 --> 00:04:58.298 align:start size:94% position:6%
that she's like an angel
we got to know.

00:04:58.298 --> 00:04:59.699 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-She's one of the most --

00:04:59.699 --> 00:05:00.733 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Audience "awws" ]
It's true.

00:05:00.733 --> 00:05:01.734 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Wait till you meet her.

00:05:01.734 --> 00:05:03.136 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Yay!

00:05:03.136 --> 00:05:04.337 size:78% position:39% line:92%
No, I'm just kidding.

00:05:04.337 --> 00:05:05.104 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:05.104 --> 00:05:08.608 size:78% position:39%
But, no, she was such
an unbelievable guide

00:05:08.608 --> 00:05:09.575 line:92%
and spirit animal for the movie.

00:05:09.575 --> 00:05:11.911 align:start size:94% position:6%
And she was just the most
beautiful person to be around.

00:05:11.911 --> 00:05:14.213 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You got --
This must be really nice

00:05:14.213 --> 00:05:15.381 line:92%
when you have a movie come out.

00:05:15.381 --> 00:05:18.851 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, these are friends
