-Yes.

00:05:24.324 --> 00:05:26.125 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think that's
very high praise.

00:05:26.125 --> 00:05:28.494 size:84% position:42% line:92%
This one's pretty good.

00:05:28.494 --> 00:05:31.397 align:start size:94% position:6%
