00:05:39.038 --> 00:05:42.408
Yeah. And then -- but this is
really the highlight, right?

00:05:42.408 --> 00:05:43.710 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This was mental. Yeah.
-Stephen King.

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:45.411 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"A Quiet Place" is an
extraordinary piece of work.

00:05:45.411 --> 00:05:47.113 align:start size:94% position:6%
Terrific acting, but the main
